This folder is populated by the Compact compiler and must not be hand-edited.

Generate it locally with:

    compact compile contracts/voting.compact managed/voting

That produces managed/voting/contract/index.cjs (the compiled contract
artifact used by the TypeScript API and tests) plus the verifier/prover
keys. It is regenerated by CI on every push (see .github/workflows/ci.yml)
and is intentionally left out of this scaffold/zip since it is a build
artifact, not source — the same way you wouldn't commit a `dist/` folder.
